/* 自动生成（R334）：英语写作 · 作文300篇追加批次 —— 用户提供的 70 篇（七年级范文 + 逐篇中文译文）
   字段：{id,title,titleZh,en,zh,level,src}；重新生成请跑 node _gen_r334_essay70.js，不要手工改写。 */
window.EN_ESSAY_R334_SEED = [{"id":"r334e01","title":"Myself","titleZh":"","en":"My name is Li Hua. I am twelve years old. I am a student at a middle school in Shanghai. I live with my father, my mother and my younger sister. My father is an engineer. My mother is a nurse. They are both very busy, but they always have dinner with us in the evening. I am tall and thin. I have short black hair and brown eyes. I wear glasses because I cannot see clearly without them. At school, my favourite subject is English. I think it is interesting and useful. I also like music. I can play the piano, but I cannot play it very well. I practice every Saturday morning. After school, I often play badminton with my friends. I want to be a doctor in the future. I know it is not easy, but I am ready to work hard. I believe that if I study carefully every day, I can make my dream come true.","zh":"我叫李华，今年十二岁。我是上海一所中学的学生。我和爸爸、妈妈还有妹妹住在一起。爸爸是一名工程师。妈妈是一名护士。他们都很忙，但晚上总是和我们一起吃晚饭。我又高又瘦。我留着黑色短发，有一双棕色的眼睛。我戴眼镜，因为不戴眼镜就看不清。在学校，我最喜欢的科目是英语。我觉得它既有趣又有用。我也喜欢音乐。我会弹钢琴，但弹得不太好。我每周六上午练习。放学后，我经常和朋友们打羽毛球。我将来想成为一名医生。我知道这不容易，但我愿意努力。我相信，如果我每天认真学习，我就能实现梦想。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e02","title":"My Family","titleZh":"","en":"There are four people in my family: my father, my mother, my brother and I. We live in a small flat near a park in Shanghai. My father works in a bank. He leaves home at seven every morning and comes back at seven in the evening. My mother is a teacher in a primary school. She teaches Chinese. She is very patient with her students. My brother is only five years old. He goes to kindergarten. He likes drawing and singing. He often makes us laugh. On weekends, we usually go to the park together. My father likes running. My mother likes walking. My brother and I like flying kites. In the evening, we sometimes watch a film at home. My mother cooks dinner, and my father washes the dishes. We help each other. I think my family is not rich, but it is warm and happy. I love my family very much.","zh":"我家有四口人：爸爸、妈妈、哥哥和我。我们住在上海一个靠近公园的小公寓里。爸爸在一家银行工作。他每天早上七点离家，晚上七点回来。妈妈是一所小学的老师。她教语文。她对她的学生很有耐心。哥哥只有五岁。他上幼儿园。他喜欢画画和唱歌。他经常逗我们笑。周末，我们通常一起去公园。爸爸喜欢跑步。妈妈喜欢散步。哥哥和我喜欢放风筝。晚上，我们有时在家看电影。妈妈做晚饭，爸爸洗碗。我们互相帮助。我觉得我家不富有，但很温暖、很快乐。我非常爱我的家人。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e03","title":"My Best Friend","titleZh":"","en":"My best friend is Wang Ming. We are in the same class. We have known each other since primary school. Wang Ming is taller than me, and he is very good at sports. He can run very fast and play basketball well. He is also kind and helpful. When I have problems with my maths homework, he always explains them to me patiently. I help him with his English in return. We often go to the school library together after class. Sometimes we read books, and sometimes we do our homework there. On Sundays, we usually ride bikes in the park near our homes. Last month, we joined a reading club at the library. We read a short English story and talked about it with other students. It was a little difficult, but we enjoyed it. I am lucky to have a friend like Wang Ming. A good friend makes life better.","zh":"我最好的朋友是王明。我们在同一个班。我们从小学就认识了。王明比我高，他非常擅长运动。他跑得很快，篮球也打得很好。他也很友善、乐于助人。当我的数学作业有困难时，他总是耐心地给我讲解。作为回报，我帮他学英语。放学后我们经常一起去学校图书馆。有时我们看书，有时我们在那里做作业。星期天，我们通常在家附近的公园骑自行车。上个月，我们参加了图书馆的一个阅读俱乐部。我们读了一个英语短故事，和其他同学一起讨论。有点难，但我们很享受。我很幸运有王明这样的朋友。好朋友让生活更美好。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e04","title":"My Parents","titleZh":"","en":"My parents are ordinary people, but they mean a lot to me. My father is a taxi driver. He works long hours and often comes home late. He does not talk much, but he always remembers the small things I like. Once I said I wanted a new football, and two days later, he brought one home. My mother works in a supermarket. She is careful with money because she wants to save for my education. She cooks breakfast for me every morning before I go to school. She also checks my homework in the evening, even when she is tired. My parents are not famous or rich, but they work hard for our family. They teach me to be honest and to do my best. I want to study well so that I can take care of them when they get old. I am thankful for everything they do for me.","zh":"我的父母是普通人，但他们对我的意义很大。爸爸是一名出租车司机。他工作时间很长，经常很晚回家。他话不多，但总是记得我喜欢的那些小事。有一次我说想要一个新足球，两天后他就带了一个回家。妈妈在一家超市工作。她花钱很仔细，因为她想为我的教育存钱。她每天早上在我上学前给我做早饭。晚上她还会检查我的作业，即使她很累。我的父母不出名，也不富有，但他们为家庭努力工作。他们教我要诚实、要尽力而为。我想好好学习，这样等他们老了，我就能照顾他们。我感激他们为我做的一切。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e05","title":"My Grandparents","titleZh":"","en":"My grandparents live in a small town not far from Shanghai. We visit them about once a month. Their house is old but very comfortable. There is a small garden in front of it. My grandfather grows vegetables and flowers there. He gets up early every morning and works in the garden for an hour. My grandmother likes cooking. She makes the best dumplings in the world. When we arrive, she always prepares a big meal for us. My grandfather often tells me stories about his childhood. He says life was much harder when he was young, but people were close to each other. I like listening to him. Sometimes we play chess together. My grandmother and my mother talk in the kitchen. These visits are simple, but I always feel happy there. I hope my grandparents stay healthy for many years.","zh":"我的祖父母住在离上海不远的一个小镇上。我们大约每个月去看他们一次。他们的房子很旧，但非常舒适。房子前面有一个小花园。祖父在那里种蔬菜和花。他每天早起，在花园里干一个小时活。祖母喜欢做饭。她做的饺子是世界上最好吃的。我们一到，她总是为我们准备一大桌饭菜。祖父经常给我讲他童年的故事。他说他年轻时生活艰难得多，但人们彼此很亲近。我喜欢听他讲。有时我们一起下棋。祖母和妈妈在厨房里聊天。这些探望很简单，但我在那里总是感到快乐。我希望祖父母健康长寿。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e06","title":"My Room","titleZh":"","en":"My room is not big, but it is my favourite place at home. There is a bed near the window, a desk next to the bed, and a bookshelf on the wall. The walls are light blue, because blue makes me feel calm. On my desk, I have a lamp, a pencil box and a photo of my family. I do my homework at the desk every evening. My bookshelf is full of books. I have storybooks, science books and some English picture books. I keep my school things in a drawer. I try to keep my room tidy, but sometimes it gets messy after a busy week. On Sunday mornings, I clean my room. I open the window to let fresh air in. I put my books back on the shelf and wash the floor. After that, I feel good. A clean room helps me think clearly and study better.","zh":"我的房间不大，但它是我家里最喜欢的地方。窗边有一张床，床边有一张书桌，墙上有一个书架。墙是浅蓝色的，因为蓝色让我感到平静。书桌上有一盏台灯、一个铅笔盒和一张全家福。我每天晚上在书桌上做作业。书架上摆满了书。我有故事书、科学书和一些英语绘本。我把学习用品放在一个抽屉里。我尽量保持房间整洁，但忙碌一周之后，有时会变乱。星期天上午，我打扫房间。我打开窗户让新鲜空气进来。我把书放回书架，拖地。之后，我感觉很好。干净的房间帮助我清楚地思考，更好地学习。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e07","title":"A Day in My Life","titleZh":"","en":"Every day, I get up at six forty. I brush my teeth and wash my face. Then I have breakfast with my family. I usually have milk, bread and an egg. At seven twenty, I go to school by bus. My first class starts at eight. I have four classes in the morning and two in the afternoon. My favourite subjects are English and science. At noon, I have lunch in the school canteen with my classmates. After school, I go home and do my homework. It usually takes me about an hour. Then I help my mother set the table for dinner. In the evening, I read a book or listen to music for a short time. I go to bed at nine thirty. Before I sleep, I think about the next day. My life is busy, but it is regular and happy. I think a good daily routine is important for students.","zh":"每天我六点四十起床。我刷牙洗脸。然后和家人一起吃早饭。我通常喝牛奶、吃面包和一个鸡蛋。七点二十，我坐公交车去学校。第一节课八点开始。我上午有四节课，下午有两节。我最喜欢的科目是英语和科学。中午，我和同学在学校食堂吃午饭。放学后，我回家做作业。通常需要大约一个小时。然后我帮妈妈摆餐具准备晚饭。晚上，我看一会儿书或听一会儿音乐。我九点半睡觉。睡前我会想第二天的事。我的生活很忙，但很有规律，也很快乐。我觉得良好的日常作息对学生很重要。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e08","title":"My Weekend","titleZh":"","en":"My weekend is usually busy but enjoyable. On Saturday morning, I go to an English class. It starts at nine and ends at eleven. After class, I have lunch with my mother at a small restaurant near the class. In the afternoon, I do my homework. I try to finish it on Saturday so that Sunday is free. On Saturday evening, I sometimes watch a film with my family. On Sunday morning, I help my parents with housework. I clean the floor and take out the rubbish. After that, I go to the park with my friends. We play basketball or ride bikes. In the evening, I prepare my schoolbag and clothes for Monday. I also read for thirty minutes before bed. Some students say weekends are for rest only, but I think a good weekend should have both rest and preparation. Then Monday does not feel so hard.","zh":"我的周末通常很忙，但很愉快。星期六上午我去上英语课。课从九点开始，十一点结束。下课后我和妈妈在附近一家小餐馆吃午饭。下午我做作业。我尽量星期六完成，这样星期天就自由了。星期六晚上，我有时和家人看电影。星期天上午，我帮父母做家务。我拖地、倒垃圾。之后我和朋友们去公园。我们打篮球或骑自行车。晚上，我准备好星期一的书包和衣服。睡前我还读三十分钟书。有些学生说周末只是用来休息的，但我觉得一个好的周末应该既有休息也有准备。这样星期一就不会那么难熬了。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e09","title":"My Favourite Season","titleZh":"","en":"My favourite season is autumn. In Shanghai, autumn usually comes in October. The weather becomes cool and dry. The summer heat is gone, so I can enjoy outdoor activities again. I like walking in the park and looking at the yellow and red leaves. The sky is often clear and blue. Autumn is also a good time for sports. Our school holds a sports meeting every October. Last year, I ran in the 800-metre race. I did not win, but I finished it. I felt proud of myself. Another reason I like autumn is that my birthday is in November. My family usually has a small dinner for me. My mother makes a cake, and my friends give me cards. Autumn is not too hot or too cold. It is comfortable and beautiful. That is why I like it best.","zh":"我最喜欢的季节是秋天。在上海，秋天通常十月到来。天气变得凉爽干燥。夏天的炎热过去了，所以我又可以享受户外活动了。我喜欢在公园里散步，看黄色和红色的树叶。天空常常晴朗湛蓝。秋天也是运动的好时节。我们学校每年十月举行运动会。去年我参加了800米赛跑。我没有赢，但我跑完了。我为自己感到骄傲。我喜欢秋天的另一个原因是我的生日在十一月。家人通常会为我准备一顿小小的晚餐。妈妈做一个蛋糕，朋友们送我卡片。秋天不太热也不太冷。它舒适又美丽。这就是我最喜欢它的原因。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e10","title":"A Letter to My Pen Friend","titleZh":"","en":"Dear Tom,\n\nHow are you? I am glad to be your pen friend. My name is Chen Jie. I am thirteen years old. I live in Shanghai with my family. Shanghai is a big and modern city. There are many tall buildings and busy streets. But there are also beautiful parks and old streets. I like my city because it is lively and convenient.\n\nI go to a middle school near my home. I am in Grade Seven. I have many subjects: Chinese, maths, English, science, history and PE. I like English best because I want to travel around the world one day. I also like PE because I can play basketball with my classmates.\n\nIn my free time, I like reading and listening to music. I also like watching films. What about you? What subjects do you like? What do you do after school? Please write to me soon.\n\nYours,\nChen Jie","zh":"亲爱的汤姆：你好！我很高兴成为你的笔友。我叫陈洁，今年十三岁。我和家人住在上海。上海是一座又大又现代的城市。有许多高楼大厦和繁忙的街道。但也有很多美丽的公园和老街。我喜欢我的城市，因为它热闹又方便。我在家附近的一所中学上学。我上七年级。我有很多科目：语文、数学、英语、科学、历史和体育。我最喜欢英语，因为我想有一天环游世界。我也喜欢体育，因为我可以和同学打篮球。在空闲时间，我喜欢阅读和听音乐。我也喜欢看电影。你呢？你喜欢什么科目？放学后你做什么？请尽快给我回信。你的，陈洁\n二、学校与学习（11—20）","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e11","title":"My School","titleZh":"","en":"My school is in the east of Shanghai. It is not very big, but it is clean and beautiful. There are two teaching buildings, a library, a playground and a small garden. The library is my favourite place. It has many books and quiet reading rooms. I often go there after class. Our teachers are strict but kind. They help us when we have problems. There are about forty students in my class. We are like a big family. We study together and play together. Our school has many activities. In September, we have a sports meeting. In December, we have an art festival. Students sing, dance and show their paintings. I am proud of my school. I think a good school is not only a place for lessons, but also a place where students learn to grow up.","zh":"我的学校在上海东部。它不很大，但干净美丽。有两栋教学楼、一个图书馆、一个操场和一个小花园。图书馆是我最喜欢的地方。它有很多书和安静的阅览室。放学后我经常去那里。我们的老师严格但和善。我们有问题时他们会帮助我们。我班上大约有四十名学生。我们就像一个大家庭。我们一起学习，一起玩耍。我们学校有很多活动。九月有运动会。十二月有艺术节。学生们唱歌、跳舞，展示绘画。我为我的学校感到骄傲。我觉得好学校不仅是上课的地方，也是学生学会成长的地方。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e12","title":"My Favourite Subject","titleZh":"","en":"My favourite subject is English. Some of my classmates think English is difficult, but I find it interesting. I like learning new words and reading short stories in English. Our English teacher, Miss Li, is very helpful. She often tells us to listen to English songs and watch simple English films. She says the most important thing is to use the language, not just remember rules. English helps me know more about the world. I can read English websites and understand some news. I also want to talk with people from other countries in the future. Of course, I have problems too. Sometimes I forget new words, and sometimes I make grammar mistakes. But I do not give up. I read English for twenty minutes every evening. I believe that practice makes perfect.","zh":"我最喜欢的科目是英语。我的一些同学觉得英语难，但我觉得它有趣。我喜欢学新单词、读英语短故事。我们的英语老师李老师非常乐于帮助我们。她经常让我们听英语歌、看简单的英语电影。她说最重要的是使用语言，而不仅仅是记规则。英语帮助我更多地了解世界。我可以读英语网站，理解一些新闻。我将来还想和来自其他国家的人交谈。当然，我也有问题。有时我忘记新单词，有时犯语法错误。但我不放弃。我每天晚上读二十分钟英语。我相信熟能生巧。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e13","title":"Our English Teacher","titleZh":"","en":"Our English teacher is Miss Wang. She is about thirty years old. She is not very tall, and she always wears a big smile. Her classes are lively and interesting. She does not only teach us words and grammar. She also tells us stories about English-speaking countries. Sometimes she plays games with us in class. We learn new words through games, so we do not feel bored. Miss Wang is patient. When we do not understand something, she explains it again and again until we get it. She also cares about our lives. Once I was ill and missed two days of school. She called me and told me what to study. I felt warm. I think a good teacher is like a lamp. She lights the way for students. Miss Wang is that kind of teacher for me.","zh":"我们的英语老师是王老师。她大约三十岁。她不太高，总是带着灿烂的笑容。她的课生动有趣。她不仅教我们单词和语法。她还给我们讲英语国家的故事。有时她在课上和我们做游戏。我们通过游戏学新单词，所以不会觉得无聊。王老师很有耐心。我们不懂的时候，她会一遍又一遍地解释，直到我们明白。她也很关心我们的生活。有一次我病了，缺了两天课。她打电话给我，告诉我该学什么。我感到很温暖。我觉得好老师就像一盏灯。她为学生照亮道路。王老师对我来说就是这样的老师。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e14","title":"A School Day","titleZh":"","en":"I usually arrive at school at seven fifty. The first class begins at eight. We have four classes in the morning. Between classes, we have a ten-minute break. During the break, some students talk, some go to the toilet, and some stay in the classroom to review. I usually go to the playground with my friends. We walk and talk. At twelve, we have lunch in the canteen. The food is not bad. My favourite is the rice with chicken and vegetables. After lunch, we have a short rest. In the afternoon, we have two or three classes. The last class ends at four ten. After school, I sometimes stay for a club. On Mondays, I go to the reading club. I like it because I can read quietly and share ideas with others. Then I go home and start my homework. A school day is long, but I learn something new every day.","zh":"我通常七点五十到校。第一节课八点开始。我们上午有四节课。课间有十分钟休息。休息时，有些同学聊天，有些去厕所，有些留在教室里复习。我通常和朋友们去操场。我们边走边聊。十二点我们在食堂吃午饭。饭菜还不错。我最喜欢的是鸡肉蔬菜饭。午饭后我们短暂休息。下午我们有两三节课。最后一节课四点十分结束。放学后，我有时留下来参加社团。星期一我去阅读社。我喜欢它，因为我可以安静地读书，和别人分享想法。然后我回家开始做作业。上学日很长，但我每天都学到新东西。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e15","title":"Our School Library","titleZh":"","en":"Our school library is on the second floor of the main building. It is not very large, but it has many books. There are storybooks, science books, history books and English books. Students can borrow up to three books at a time. The library is open from nine to five on school days. It is a quiet place. When you walk in, you see students reading at tables. Nobody talks loudly. I like to go there after class. Sometimes I do my homework there because it is quieter than my classroom. Sometimes I read a book for fun. Last week, I borrowed a book about animals. It was very interesting. I learned that some animals can sleep for months. The library also has a small corner with English picture books. I want to read more English books this year. A library is a treasure box of knowledge.","zh":"我们的学校图书馆在主楼的二层。它不很大，但有很多书。有故事书、科学书、历史书和英语书。学生一次可以借三本书。图书馆在上学日九点到五点开放。它是一个安静的地方。走进去，你会看到学生们在桌边读书。没有人大声说话。我喜欢放学后去那里。有时我在那里做作业，因为比教室安静。有时我读一本书消遣。上周我借了一本关于动物的书。非常有趣。我了解到有些动物能睡好几个月。图书馆还有一个小角落放英语绘本。今年我想读更多的英语书。图书馆是一个知识的宝盒。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e16","title":"A Class Activity","titleZh":"","en":"Last Friday, our class had a special activity. We went to a science museum near our school. We walked there because it was only fifteen minutes away. In the museum, we saw many interesting things. We learned how electricity works. We also saw a model of the human body. Our science teacher explained things to us. I liked the robot show best. A robot moved its arms and picked up a ball. It was amazing. After the visit, we sat in a small park and had lunch. We talked about what we saw. Some students said they wanted to become scientists. I think activities like this are important. We do not only learn from books. We also learn by seeing and doing. I hope we can have more class activities like this one.","zh":"上周五，我们班有一个特别的活动。我们去了学校附近的一个科学博物馆。我们步行去那里，因为只有十五分钟的路程。在博物馆里，我们看到了许多有趣的东西。我们了解了电是如何工作的。我们还看到了一个人体模型。科学老师给我们讲解。我最喜欢机器人表演。一个机器人移动手臂，捡起一个球。太神奇了。参观结束后，我们坐在一个小公园里吃午饭。我们谈论看到的东西。有些同学说他们想成为科学家。我觉得这样的活动很重要。我们不仅从书本上学习。我们也通过观察和实践来学习。我希望我们能多参加这样的班级活动。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e17","title":"My Homework Routine","titleZh":"","en":"Homework is part of every student's life. I usually have homework in Chinese, maths and English every day. Sometimes I also have science or history homework. I get home at about four forty. After a short break, I start my homework at five. I do the hardest subject first, because my mind is fresh. Then I do the easier ones. I take a five-minute break between subjects. I do not use my phone while I am doing homework. If I have a question, I first try to solve it by myself. If I still cannot, I ask my parents or look in my books. I try to finish my homework before dinner. After dinner, I check my work and prepare my schoolbag for the next day. On average, I spend about one and a half hours on homework. I think a regular homework routine helps me stay calm and do better.","zh":"作业是每个学生生活的一部分。我通常每天有语文、数学和英语作业。有时还有科学或历史作业。我大约四点四十到家。短暂休息后，我五点开始做作业。我先做最难的科目，因为那时头脑清醒。然后做容易的。科目之间我休息五分钟。做作业时我不用手机。如果有问题，我先试着自己解决。如果还是不行，我就问父母或翻书。我尽量在晚饭前完成作业。晚饭后，我检查作业，准备好第二天的书包。平均来说，我花大约一个半小时做作业。我觉得规律的作业习惯帮助我保持平静，做得更好。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e18","title":"A Difficult Test","titleZh":"","en":"Last week, I had a maths test. I was nervous because maths is not my best subject. The night before the test, I reviewed my notes and did some practice exercises. My mother helped me with one difficult problem. I went to bed early so that I could think clearly the next day. On the day of the test, I read every question carefully. The first few questions were easy. Then I saw a long problem. I did not know how to start. I took a deep breath and remembered what my teacher said: \"Read it again and write down what you know.\" I followed her advice. Slowly, I found the way to solve it. In the end, I got 85 out of 100. I was happy, but I also knew I could do better. I learned that being nervous does not help. Being prepared and staying calm are more useful.","zh":"上周我有一场数学考试。我很紧张，因为数学不是我最好的科目。考试前一晚，我复习笔记，做了一些练习题。妈妈帮我解决了一道难题。我很早就睡了，这样第二天头脑清醒。考试那天，我仔细读每一道题。前几道题很简单。然后我看到一道很长的题。我不知道怎么开始。我深吸一口气，想起老师说的话：“再读一遍，把你已知的写下来。”我照她说的做。慢慢地，我找到了解题方法。最后我得了85分。我很高兴，但也知道我可以做得更好。我学到了紧张没有用。做好准备、保持冷静更有用。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e19","title":"My New School Year Plan","titleZh":"","en":"The new school year has just begun. I have made a simple plan for it. First, I want to improve my English. I will read one English story every week and learn ten new words every day. Second, I want to do better in maths. I will ask my teacher when I do not understand something. Third, I want to be healthier. I will exercise for at least thirty minutes every day. I will run or play basketball with my friends. Fourth, I want to read more books, not only for school but also for fun. I will read before bed instead of looking at my phone. Finally, I want to help others more. I will be kind to my classmates and help my parents at home. I know plans are easy to make but hard to keep. So I will check my plan every month and see what I have done.","zh":"新学年刚刚开始。我为它制定了一个简单的计划。第一，我想提高英语。我每周读一个英语故事，每天学十个新单词。第二，我想在数学上做得更好。不懂的时候我会问老师。第三，我想更健康。我每天至少锻炼三十分钟。我会和朋友跑步或打篮球。第四，我想读更多书，不仅为学校，也为乐趣。我会在睡前读书，而不是看手机。最后，我想更多地帮助别人。我会对同学友善，在家帮助父母。我知道计划容易制定，但难以坚持。所以我会每月检查计划，看看自己做到了什么。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e20","title":"An Email to a Classmate Who Was Ill","titleZh":"","en":"Dear Andy,\n\nI am sorry to hear that you are ill and missed the history class today. I hope you feel better soon.\n\nIn today's class, we learned about the Silk Road. Our teacher showed us a map and told us how people traded goods long ago. She also gave us some notes. I have written them down for you. You can copy them when you come back.\n\nOur homework is to write a short paragraph about one thing that travelled along the Silk Road. You do not need to finish it today. Take a good rest first.\n\nBy the way, the school football match is next Friday. We all hope you can come and watch. Please tell me when you think you can return to school.\n\nGet well soon.\n\nYours,\nLi Hua","zh":"亲爱的安迪：听说你病了，今天缺了历史课，我很难过。希望你早日康复。今天的课上我们学习了丝绸之路。老师给我们看了一张地图，讲了很久以前人们如何交易货物。她还发了一些笔记。我帮你抄下来了。你回来后可以抄。我们的作业是写一小段关于丝绸之路上传播的某样东西。你今天不用完成。先好好休息。顺便说一下，学校足球赛在下周五。我们都希望你能来看。请告诉我你觉得什么时候能回学校。早日康复。你的，李华\n三、日常生活与习惯（21—30）","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e21","title":"Getting Up Early","titleZh":"","en":"Getting up early is not easy for me, but I have learned to do it. Last year, I often woke up late and rushed to school without breakfast. I felt tired all morning, and I could not focus in class. My mother told me that a good day starts from a good morning. So I decided to change. Now I set my alarm clock for six thirty. I put the clock across the room so that I have to get out of bed to turn it off. Then I open the window and drink a glass of water. I wash my face with cold water. After that, I feel awake. I have enough time to eat breakfast and walk to the bus stop slowly. I am not late anymore. I also feel more energetic in class. Getting up early is a small habit, but it has made a big difference to my life.","zh":"早起对我来说不容易，但我学会了。去年我经常醒得晚，不吃早饭就冲去学校。整个上午我都觉得累，上课无法集中注意力。妈妈告诉我，好的一天从好的早晨开始。所以我决定改变。现在我把闹钟定在六点半。我把钟放在房间另一边，这样我必须下床去关它。然后我打开窗户，喝一杯水。我用冷水洗脸。之后我就清醒了。我有足够的时间吃早饭，慢慢走到公交站。我不再迟到了。我在课上也觉得更有精神了。早起是一个小习惯，但它对我的生活产生了很大的影响。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e22","title":"My Favourite Food","titleZh":"","en":"My favourite food is dumplings. In China, dumplings are more than just food. They are part of family life. My grandmother makes the best dumplings. She mixes meat and vegetables for the filling. Then she makes the dough and rolls it into small thin pieces. We sit around the table and make dumplings together. I am not very good at it. My dumplings are sometimes too big or not closed well. But we laugh and enjoy the time. We usually eat dumplings on cold days, especially in winter. When the dumplings are ready, the kitchen smells wonderful. I like eating them with a little vinegar. For me, dumplings taste like home. I think the best food is not always from a restaurant. Sometimes it is the food you make with your family.","zh":"我最喜欢的食物是饺子。在中国，饺子不仅仅是食物。它们是家庭生活的一部分。我祖母做的饺子最好吃。她把肉和蔬菜拌成馅。然后她和面，擀成小薄片。我们围坐在桌旁一起包饺子。我不太擅长。我包的饺子有时太大，或者口没捏好。但我们笑着，享受这段时光。我们通常在冷天吃饺子，尤其是冬天。饺子煮好时，厨房里香气扑鼻。我喜欢蘸一点醋吃。对我来说，饺子的味道就是家的味道。我觉得最好的食物不一定来自餐馆。有时它是你和家人一起做的食物。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e23","title":"Breakfast","titleZh":"","en":"Many students do not eat breakfast. They say they have no time or they are not hungry. I think breakfast is the most important meal of the day. After a long night, our body needs energy. Without breakfast, we may feel tired and cannot think well in class. My breakfast is simple. I usually have a glass of milk, an egg and some bread. Sometimes I have noodles or porridge. My mother says warm food is good for the stomach in the morning. I get up fifteen minutes earlier so that I can sit down and eat slowly. I do not watch my phone during breakfast. I just eat and talk with my family. This short time makes me feel calm and ready for the day. If you do not eat breakfast now, try to start with something small. Your body and your brain will thank you.","zh":"很多学生不吃早饭。他们说没时间或者不饿。我觉得早饭是一天中最重要的一餐。经过漫长的一夜，我们的身体需要能量。不吃早饭，我们可能会觉得累，上课无法好好思考。我的早饭很简单。我通常喝一杯牛奶，吃一个鸡蛋和一些面包。有时我吃面条或粥。妈妈说早上吃温热的食物对胃好。我早起十五分钟，这样就能坐下来慢慢吃。早饭时我不看手机。我只是吃饭，和家人聊天。这段短暂的时间让我感到平静，准备好迎接一天。如果你现在不吃早饭，试着从吃一点东西开始。你的身体和大脑会感谢你。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e24","title":"Doing Housework","titleZh":"","en":"Some students think housework is only for parents. I do not agree. I think everyone in the family should help. In my home, we share the housework. My father washes the dishes after dinner. My mother cooks. I clean the floor and take out the rubbish. My younger sister puts the clean clothes in the wardrobe. On weekends, we do a big clean together. I clean my room and the bathroom. It takes about an hour. I do not love housework, but I know it is necessary. When I clean my room, I feel comfortable. When I help my mother, she has more time to rest. I also learn useful skills. I can wash my own clothes and make simple meals. These skills will be important when I grow up. Housework is not a punishment. It is part of being a family member.","zh":"有些学生觉得家务只是父母的事。我不同意。我觉得家里每个人都应该帮忙。在我家，我们分担家务。爸爸晚饭后洗碗。妈妈做饭。我拖地、倒垃圾。妹妹把干净的衣服放进衣柜。周末我们一起大扫除。我打扫自己的房间和卫生间。大约需要一个小时。我不喜欢做家务，但我知道这是必要的。当我打扫完房间，我感觉很舒服。当我帮妈妈时，她就有更多时间休息。我也学到了有用的技能。我可以自己洗衣服，做简单的饭菜。这些技能等我长大后很重要。家务不是惩罚。它是作为家庭成员的一部分。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e25","title":"A Rainy Day","titleZh":"","en":"Last Tuesday was a rainy day. I woke up and heard the rain on the window. The sky was grey. I did not want to get up. But I had to go to school. I put on my raincoat and boots and took my umbrella. The bus was late because of the rain. Many people were waiting at the stop. When the bus came, it was crowded. I stood near the door and tried not to get wet. At school, my shoes were a little wet, but I was okay. In the afternoon, the rain stopped. The air was fresh and clean. After school, I walked home slowly. There were puddles on the road. I jumped over them like a child. My mother made hot soup for dinner. It was a simple day, but I felt warm and safe. Sometimes rainy days are not so bad.","zh":"上周二是下雨天。我醒来听到雨打在窗户上的声音。天空灰蒙蒙的。我不想起床。但我必须去上学。我穿上雨衣和靴子，带上雨伞。因为下雨，公交车晚了。很多人在车站等。公交车来了，很拥挤。我站在门边，尽量不淋湿。到学校时，鞋子有点湿，但还好。下午雨停了。空气清新干净。放学后我慢慢走回家。路上有水坑。我像孩子一样跳过去。妈妈做了热汤当晚饭。这是简单的一天，但我感到温暖和安全。有时候下雨天也没那么糟。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e26","title":"My Favourite Place in My Home","titleZh":"","en":"My favourite place at home is the balcony. It is not big, but it is full of light. There are some green plants on the balcony. My mother grows tomatoes and flowers there. There is also a small chair and a little table. In the morning, the sun comes in. It is warm and quiet. I like to sit there and read a book or just look outside. I can see trees, birds and people walking on the street. In the evening, I sometimes sit there with my father. We talk about school or listen to music. On summer nights, we can see the moon and stars. The balcony is not a fancy place, but it makes me feel peaceful. When I am tired or worried, I go there for a few minutes. After that, I feel better. Everyone needs a small quiet corner.","zh":"我家里最喜欢的地方是阳台。它不大，但充满了光。阳台上有些绿色植物。妈妈在那里种西红柿和花。还有一把小椅子和一张小桌子。早上阳光照进来。温暖又安静。我喜欢坐在那里看书，或者只是看看外面。我能看到树木、鸟儿和街上走路的人。晚上，我有时和爸爸坐在那里。我们聊学校的事，或者听音乐。夏夜，我们可以看到月亮和星星。阳台不是什么豪华的地方，但它让我感到平静。当我累了或担心时，我会去那里待几分钟。之后我感觉好一些。每个人都需要一个小小的安静角落。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e27","title":"Shopping with My Mother","titleZh":"","en":"On Saturday afternoon, I went shopping with my mother. We went to a supermarket near our home. My mother had a shopping list. She needed rice, eggs, vegetables, milk and some cleaning things. The supermarket was busy. Many people were buying food for the weekend. We first went to the food section. My mother looked at the prices carefully. She bought some tomatoes, carrots and chicken. I helped her put things in the trolley. Then we went to the milk section. I chose a bottle of milk with a later date. My mother smiled and said I was careful. After shopping, we paid at the counter. There were many people waiting, so we stood in line for ten minutes. We spent about one hundred and fifty yuan. On the way home, I carried one bag. It was not heavy. Shopping with my mother is not exciting, but I like it. It is a simple time together.","zh":"星期六下午，我和妈妈去购物。我们去了家附近的一家超市。妈妈有一张购物清单。她需要大米、鸡蛋、蔬菜、牛奶和一些清洁用品。超市很忙。很多人都在买周末的食物。我们先去了食品区。妈妈仔细看价格。她买了西红柿、胡萝卜和鸡肉。我帮她把东西放进购物车。然后我们去了牛奶区。我选了一瓶日期较晚的牛奶。妈妈笑了，说我很细心。购物后，我们在收银台付款。很多人排队，我们站了十分钟。我们花了大约一百五十元。回家路上，我提了一个袋子。不重。和妈妈购物不刺激，但我喜欢。这是一段简单的共处时光。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e28","title":"A Lost and Found","titleZh":"","en":"Last Monday, I lost my pencil case. It was a blue one with a small cat on it. My aunt gave it to me for my birthday, so I was very sad. I looked in my schoolbag, under my desk and in the classroom, but I could not find it. I asked my classmates, but nobody saw it. At the end of the day, I went to the lost and found office near the school gate. There were many things in a big box: water bottles, books, a jacket and some keys. I looked carefully. At first, I did not see my pencil case. Then I saw a blue corner under a notebook. It was mine! I was so happy. The teacher asked me to write my name on it. Now I always write my name on my things. Losing something teaches you to be more careful.","zh":"上周一，我丢了铅笔盒。那是一个蓝色的，上面有一只小猫。是姑姑送给我的生日礼物，所以我很难过。我找了书包里、桌子下面和教室里，但找不到。我问了同学，但没人看见。放学时，我去了校门口的失物招领处。一个大盒子里有很多东西：水瓶、书、一件夹克和一些钥匙。我仔细看。起初我没看到我的铅笔盒。然后我在一个笔记本下面看到一个蓝色的角。是我的！我太高兴了。老师让我写上名字。现在我总是把名字写在我的东西上。丢东西教会你要更小心。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e29","title":"A Small Kindness","titleZh":"","en":"Small kindness can make a big difference. Last week, I saw an old man on the bus. He was carrying two heavy bags. The bus was crowded, and there were no seats. He looked tired. I stood up and gave him my seat. He was surprised and said \"Thank you, young man.\" I felt a little shy, but also happy. Another day, I saw a girl crying near the school gate. She could not find her mother. I stayed with her and helped her find a teacher. The teacher called her mother. The girl stopped crying. These are small things. I did not do anything special. But I think if everyone does small kind things, the world becomes warmer. We do not need to be rich or famous to help others. We just need to notice people around us and be ready to give a hand.","zh":"小小的善意能带来很大的不同。上周，我在公交车上看到一位老人。他提着两个沉重的袋子。公交车很拥挤，没有座位。他看起来很累。我站起来，把座位让给他。他很惊讶，说“谢谢你，年轻人。”我有点害羞，但也很开心。又有一天，我在校门口看到一个女孩在哭。她找不到妈妈了。我陪着她，帮她找老师。老师给她妈妈打了电话。女孩不哭了。这些都是小事。我没有做什么特别的事。但我觉得如果每个人都做小小的善事，世界会变得更温暖。我们不需要富有或出名才能帮助别人。我们只需要留意身边的人，随时准备伸出援手。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e30","title":"My Evening Routine","titleZh":"","en":"My evening routine is simple. I get home at about four forty. I wash my hands and have a snack. Then I start my homework at five. I work for about forty minutes, take a short break, and then continue. I try to finish before seven. At seven, we have dinner together. During dinner, we talk about our day. My father asks about school, and I ask about his work. After dinner, I help clean the table. Then I have some free time. I usually read or listen to music. Sometimes I practice the piano for twenty minutes. At eight thirty, I take a shower. Then I prepare my schoolbag and clothes for the next day. I go to bed at nine thirty. Before I sleep, I read for a few minutes. I think a good evening routine helps me end the day calmly and start the next day well.","zh":"我的晚间作息很简单。我大约四点四十到家。我洗手，吃点东西。然后五点开始做作业。我做大约四十分钟，短暂休息，然后继续。我尽量在七点前完成。七点我们一起吃晚饭。晚饭时我们聊各自的一天。爸爸问学校的事，我问他的工作。晚饭后我帮忙收拾桌子。然后我有一些自由时间。我通常看书或听音乐。有时我练二十分钟钢琴。八点半我洗澡。然后准备第二天的书包和衣服。我九点半睡觉。睡前我读几分钟书。我觉得好的晚间作息帮助我平静地结束一天，好好地开始第二天。\n\n三、爱好与运动（31—40）","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e31","title":"My Hobby","titleZh":"","en":"My hobby is reading. I started reading storybooks when I was six. Now I read many kinds of books: stories, science, history and travel. I usually read for thirty minutes before bed. On weekends, I read longer. I like reading because it opens a window to the world. I can visit other countries, meet interesting people and learn new things without leaving my room. Reading also helps my English. I learn new words and see how sentences are built. Sometimes I read English picture books. They are easy, but I still learn from them. My favourite book is a story about a boy and his dog. It is funny and warm. I have read it three times. I think everyone should have a hobby. A hobby makes life more colourful and gives you a way to relax.","zh":"我的爱好是阅读。我六岁开始读故事书。现在我读很多种类的书：故事、科学、历史和旅行。我通常睡前读三十分钟。周末读得更久。我喜欢阅读，因为它打开了一扇看世界的窗。我可以不出房间就游览其他国家、遇见有趣的人、学习新事物。阅读也帮助我的英语。我学到新单词，看到句子是如何构成的。有时我读英语绘本。它们很简单，但我仍然能从中学到东西。我最喜欢的书是一个男孩和他的狗的故事。它有趣又温暖。我读过三遍。我觉得每个人都应该有一个爱好。爱好让生活更丰富多彩，给你一种放松的方式。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e32","title":"Playing Basketball","titleZh":"","en":"Basketball is my favourite sport. I started playing it two years ago. At first, I was not good at it. I could not throw the ball into the basket. But my friend Tom taught me. He said, \"Keep your eyes on the basket and use your legs.\" I practiced every afternoon after school. Slowly, I got better. Now I play with my classmates on the school playground. We have a small team. We practice on Tuesdays and Thursdays. Last month, we had a match with another class. We did not win, but we played well. I scored four points. I was proud. Basketball is not only about scoring. It teaches us to work as a team. We pass the ball and help each other. When someone makes a mistake, we say \"It's okay. Try again.\" I think this is why I love basketball.","zh":"篮球是我最喜欢的运动。我两年前开始打。起初我不擅长。我投不进球。但我的朋友汤姆教我。他说：“眼睛看着篮筐，用腿发力。”我每天放学后练习。慢慢地，我进步了。现在我和同学在学校操场打球。我们有一个小队。我们星期二和星期四练习。上个月我们和另一个班比赛。我们没有赢，但打得不错。我得了四分。我很骄傲。篮球不仅仅是得分。它教我们团队合作。我们传球，互相帮助。有人犯错时，我们说“没关系，再试一次。”我觉得这就是我喜欢篮球的原因。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e33","title":"Swimming in Summer","titleZh":"","en":"Summer in Shanghai is hot. The best way to cool down is swimming. Last summer, I learned to swim. My father took me to a swimming pool near our home. At first, I was afraid of water. I did not want to put my face in the water. My father said, \"Take it easy. I am here.\" He held my hands and taught me to breathe. After two weeks, I could swim a short distance. Now I can swim about twenty metres. I am not a strong swimmer, but I enjoy it. Swimming is good exercise. It makes my arms and legs strong. It also helps me relax. When I am in the water, I do not think about homework or tests. I only think about moving and breathing. I want to swim better next summer. Maybe I can swim fifty metres.","zh":"上海的夏天很热。降温的最好方式是游泳。去年夏天我学了游泳。爸爸带我去家附近的一个游泳池。起初我怕水。我不想把脸放进水里。爸爸说：“放松，我在这里。”他握着我的手，教我呼吸。两周后，我能游一小段了。现在我能游大约二十米。我不是游泳健将，但我享受它。游泳是很好的运动。它让我的胳膊和腿有力。它也帮助我放松。在水里时，我不想作业或考试。我只想着动作和呼吸。明年夏天我想游得更好。也许我能游五十米。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e34","title":"Riding a Bike","titleZh":"","en":"I learned to ride a bike when I was eight. My father bought me a small bike. It had training wheels at first. I rode around our neighbourhood with the wheels. It was easy. Then my father took the wheels off. I fell down many times. My knees hurt. I wanted to stop. But my father said, \"Everybody falls. Try again.\" I tried again and again. One afternoon, I suddenly found I could ride without falling. I was so happy. I rode to the end of the street and back. My father clapped his hands. Now I ride my bike to the park on weekends. I like the feeling of wind on my face. Riding a bike is good for my health, and it does not pollute the air. I think learning to ride a bike taught me an important lesson: do not give up when it is difficult.","zh":"我八岁学会骑自行车。爸爸给我买了一辆小自行车。起初有辅助轮。我带着轮子在小区里骑。很容易。然后爸爸把轮子拆了。我摔了很多次。膝盖很疼。我想放弃。但爸爸说：“每个人都会摔。再试试。”我一次又一次地试。一天下午，我突然发现我可以不摔倒地骑了。我太高兴了。我骑到街尾又骑回来。爸爸鼓掌。现在我周末骑车去公园。我喜欢风拂过脸颊的感觉。骑自行车对健康有益，而且不污染空气。我觉得学骑车教了我重要的一课：困难时不要放弃。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e35","title":"My Favourite Music","titleZh":"","en":"I like music very much. My favourite kind of music is pop music. I listen to it when I am happy, sad or tired. Music changes my mood. When I am stressed about school, I put on my headphones and listen to a few songs. After that, I feel better. My favourite singer is a Chinese singer. She has a clear voice and her songs are about life and dreams. I know most of her songs. I also like English songs because they help me learn English. I listen to the words and try to understand them. Sometimes I look up new words in the dictionary. I cannot play a musical instrument well, but I want to learn the guitar. I think playing music is a special skill. It can make other people happy too. Music is a friend that is always with me.","zh":"我非常喜欢音乐。我最喜欢的音乐是流行音乐。我开心、难过或累的时候都听。音乐改变我的心情。当我对学校的事感到有压力时，我戴上耳机听几首歌。之后我感觉好一些。我最喜欢的歌手是一位中国歌手。她的声音清亮，唱的是生活和梦想。她的歌我大部分都会。我也喜欢英语歌，因为它们帮我学英语。我听歌词，试着理解。有时我查字典找新单词。我乐器弹得不好，但我想学吉他。我觉得演奏音乐是一项特别的技能。它也能让别人快乐。音乐是一个永远陪伴我的朋友。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e36","title":"A Football Match","titleZh":"","en":"Last Saturday, our school football team played against a team from another school. The match started at three in the afternoon. Many students came to watch. Our team wore blue shirts, and the other team wore red. In the first half, both teams played well. Nobody scored. At half-time, our coach told us to pass the ball more. In the second half, our team became stronger. In the twentieth minute, our best player, Zhang Wei, got the ball and ran fast. He kicked the ball into the goal! Everyone shouted. The other team tried hard to score, but our goalkeeper caught the ball many times. In the end, we won 1–0. We were very excited. We ran to our coach and hugged him. It was only a school match, but it felt like a big day. I learned that teamwork and never giving up are the keys to winning.","zh":"上周六，我们学校足球队和另一所学校的队比赛。比赛下午三点开始。很多学生来看。我们队穿蓝色球衣，另一队穿红色。上半场双方都踢得很好。没有人得分。中场休息时，教练让我们多传球。下半场我们队更强了。第二十分钟，我们最好的球员张伟拿到球，跑得很快。他把球踢进了球门！所有人欢呼。另一队努力想得分，但我们的守门员多次接住球。最后我们1比0赢了。我们非常兴奋。我们跑向教练，拥抱他。这只是一场学校比赛，但感觉像一个大日子。我学到了团队合作和永不放弃是获胜的关键。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e37","title":"Collecting Stamps","titleZh":"","en":"Some people think stamp collecting is boring. I do not think so. I started collecting stamps two years ago. My uncle gave me an old stamp from England. It had a picture of a famous building. I liked it and wanted to collect more. Now I have about eighty stamps from different countries. They are in a small book. Each stamp has a story. Some show animals, some show famous people, and some show places. I like looking at them and reading about the countries. Stamp collecting teaches me geography and history. It also teaches me patience. Good stamps are not easy to find. I sometimes trade stamps with my friends. I give them a stamp they need, and they give me one I need. It is a quiet hobby, but it makes me happy. Everyone needs a hobby that is just for fun.","zh":"有些人觉得集邮无聊。我不这么认为。我两年前开始集邮。叔叔给了我一张英国的旧邮票。上面有一座著名建筑的图案。我喜欢它，想收集更多。现在我有大约八十张来自不同国家的邮票。它们在一个小册子里。每张邮票都有一个故事。有些展示动物，有些展示名人，有些展示地方。我喜欢看它们，读关于这些国家的知识。集邮教给我地理和历史。它也教我有耐心。好邮票不容易找到。我有时和朋友交换邮票。我给他们需要的，他们给我需要的。这是一个安静的爱好，但它让我快乐。每个人都需要一个纯粹为了乐趣的爱好。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e38","title":"A School Sports Meeting","titleZh":"","en":"Our school sports meeting is held every October. It is one of the most exciting days of the year. On that day, we do not have normal classes. Students wear sports clothes and sit in groups. There are many events: running, jumping, throwing and relay races. I usually take part in the 400-metre race. Last year, I practiced for two weeks before the meeting. On the day, I was nervous. When the race started, I ran as fast as I could. My friends shouted my name. I did not win a medal, but I finished in fourth place. I was tired but happy. The best part is the relay race. Four students run together. Everyone cheers loudly. When our class won the relay, we jumped and shouted. I think sports meetings are important. They teach us to try our best and to support each other.","zh":"我们学校每年十月举行运动会。这是一年中最令人兴奋的日子之一。那天我们不上正常课。学生穿运动服，分组坐。有很多项目：跑步、跳远、投掷和接力赛。我通常参加400米赛跑。去年运动会前我练习了两周。那天我很紧张。比赛开始时，我尽全力跑。朋友们喊我的名字。我没有赢得奖牌，但我得了第四名。我很累，但很开心。最精彩的部分是接力赛。四名学生一起跑。大家大声加油。我们班赢得接力时，我们跳起来欢呼。我觉得运动会很重要。它们教我们尽力而为，互相支持。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e39","title":"My Favourite Hobby — Drawing","titleZh":"","en":"Drawing is my favourite hobby. I draw almost every day. I like drawing animals, people and places I see in my life. I use pencils and coloured pens. Sometimes I use watercolours. Drawing helps me relax. When I draw, I forget about my worries. I focus on the lines and colours. It is like a quiet conversation with myself. I am not a great artist. My drawings are simple. But I enjoy the process. Last month, my art teacher chose one of my drawings for the school art show. It was a picture of my grandmother's garden. I was surprised and happy. My parents came to see it. They took a photo. I felt proud. I think everyone can draw. You do not need to be perfect. You just need to enjoy it and keep practicing.","zh":"画画是我最喜欢的爱好。我几乎每天都画。我喜欢画动物、人物和我在生活中看到的地方。我用铅笔和彩笔。有时用水彩。画画帮助我放松。当我画画时，我忘记烦恼。我专注于线条和颜色。这就像和自己安静地对话。我不是伟大的艺术家。我的画很简单。但我享受过程。上个月，美术老师选了我的一幅画参加学校艺术展。那是我祖母花园的画。我很惊讶，也很开心。父母来看，拍了照片。我感到骄傲。我觉得每个人都能画画。你不需要完美。你只需要享受它，坚持练习。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e40","title":"A Walk in the Park","titleZh":"","en":"Every Sunday morning, I take a walk in the park near my home. The park is not very big, but it has a small lake and many trees. There is a path around the lake. I walk along the path for about thirty minutes. On the way, I see many things. Old people do tai chi. Children run and play. Some people walk their dogs. Birds sing in the trees. I like the sound of birds. It makes me feel calm. Sometimes I sit on a bench and watch the water. I think about my week or just enjoy the quiet. Walking is good exercise. It is not hard, but it helps my body. More importantly, it helps my mind. After the walk, I feel fresh and ready for the week. I think everyone should spend some time in nature. It is free and good for you.","zh":"每个星期天上午，我在家附近的公园散步。公园不很大，但有一个小湖和很多树。湖边有一条小路。我沿着小路走大约三十分钟。路上我看到很多东西。老人们打太极。孩子们奔跑玩耍。有些人遛狗。鸟儿在树上唱歌。我喜欢鸟叫声。它让我感到平静。有时我坐在长椅上看着水面。我想想这一周的事，或者只是享受安静。散步是很好的运动。不剧烈，但对身体有好处。更重要的是，它对头脑有好处。散步后，我感觉清新，准备好迎接新的一周。我觉得每个人都应该花些时间亲近自然。它免费，而且对你有益。\n四、食物、购物与衣着（41—48）","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e41","title":"My Favourite Restaurant","titleZh":"","en":"There is a small restaurant near my home. It is called \"Happy Kitchen.\" It is not fancy, but the food is delicious and the price is fair. My family goes there about once a month. I usually order noodles with beef and vegetables. The noodles are hot and the soup is tasty. My father likes the fried rice. My mother likes the fish. The owner is a friendly woman. She remembers our names and always smiles. The restaurant is clean. There are only six tables, so it is quiet. I like it because it feels like a family place. We do not go there every day because my mother likes cooking at home. But when we want a small treat, we go to Happy Kitchen. Good restaurants do not need to be big or expensive. They need good food and warm people.","zh":"我家附近有一家小餐馆。它叫“快乐厨房”。不豪华，但饭菜美味，价格公道。我家大约每月去一次。我通常点牛肉蔬菜面。面条热乎，汤很好喝。爸爸喜欢炒饭。妈妈喜欢鱼。店主是一位友善的女士。她记得我们的名字，总是微笑。餐馆很干净。只有六张桌子，所以很安静。我喜欢它，因为它有家的感觉。我们不每天去，因为妈妈喜欢在家做饭。但当我们想小小享受一下时，就去快乐厨房。好餐馆不需要大或贵。它们需要好食物和温暖的人。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e42","title":"Buying a Gift for My Father","titleZh":"","en":"My father's birthday is next week. I want to buy him a gift, but I do not have much money. I have saved fifty yuan from my pocket money. I thought about what he likes. He likes reading, so I went to a bookshop. I looked at many books. I found a book about history. My father likes history. The book cost forty-five yuan. I bought it. Then I had five yuan left. I went to a small shop and bought a card. I wrote \"Happy Birthday, Dad. Thank you for working so hard for us.\" On his birthday, I will give him the book and the card. I think he will be happy. A gift does not need to be expensive. The important thing is that it comes from the heart. I am excited to see his face.","zh":"爸爸的生日在下周。我想给他买一份礼物，但我没有多少钱。我从零花钱里存了五十元。我想了他喜欢什么。他喜欢阅读，所以我去了书店。我看了很多书。我找到了一本关于历史的书。爸爸喜欢历史。这本书四十五元。我买了。然后我还剩五元。我去一家小店买了一张卡片。我写道：“爸爸生日快乐。谢谢您为我们这么努力。”在他生日那天，我会把书和卡片送给他。我觉得他会开心。礼物不需要昂贵。重要的是心意。我很期待看到他的表情。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e43","title":"My Favourite Clothes","titleZh":"","en":"My favourite clothes are a blue hoodie and black trousers. I wear them on weekends and holidays. The hoodie is comfortable and warm. It has a small pocket in front. I can put my phone or keys in it. I have had this hoodie for two years. It is a little old, but I still like it. My mother says I should wear something nicer sometimes, but I feel best in simple clothes. I do not care much about fashion. I think clothes should be comfortable first. Of course, I also wear a school uniform on school days. Our uniform is white and blue. At first, I did not like it, but now I am used to it. It saves time in the morning because I do not need to choose what to wear. Clothes are not the most important thing. A person's character is more important than their clothes.","zh":"我最喜欢的衣服是一件蓝色连帽衫和黑色裤子。我周末和假日穿。连帽衫舒适暖和。前面有一个小口袋。我可以放手机或钥匙。这件连帽衫我穿了两年了。有点旧，但我仍然喜欢。妈妈说我有时应该穿好一点，但我觉得穿简单的衣服最舒服。我不太在意时尚。我觉得衣服首先应该舒适。当然，上学日我也穿校服。我们的校服是白蓝相间的。起初我不喜欢，但现在习惯了。它早上节省时间，因为我不需要选穿什么。衣服不是最重要的。一个人的品格比衣服更重要。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e44","title":"A Trip to the Supermarket","titleZh":"","en":"Yesterday, I went to the supermarket with my mother. We needed food for the week. The supermarket was big and bright. We took a trolley and walked slowly through the aisles. My mother bought rice, oil, eggs, vegetables and fruit. I helped her choose apples. I like red apples because they are sweet. We also bought some snacks for my school bag. I chose biscuits and a bottle of juice. My mother said, \"One snack is enough.\" So I put back the biscuits. At the checkout, there were many people. We waited for about ten minutes. The total was two hundred and thirty yuan. My mother paid by phone. It was quick and easy. On the way home, I carried the heavy bag. My mother carried the light one. It was a normal shopping trip, but I enjoyed helping my mother.","zh":"昨天我和妈妈去了超市。我们需要一周的食物。超市又大又亮。我们推了一辆购物车，慢慢走过货架。妈妈买了大米、油、鸡蛋、蔬菜和水果。我帮她挑苹果。我喜欢红苹果，因为它们甜。我们还买了一些零食放我书包里。我选了饼干和一瓶果汁。妈妈说：“一样零食就够了。”所以我把饼干放了回去。结账时人很多。我们等了大约十分钟。总共两百三十元。妈妈用手机付款。又快又方便。回家路上我提重袋子。妈妈提轻的。这是一次普通的购物，但我喜欢帮妈妈。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e45","title":"Making a Fruit Salad","titleZh":"","en":"Last Sunday, I made a fruit salad for my family. It was easy and fun. I used an apple, a banana, an orange and some grapes. First, I washed the fruit carefully. Then I peeled the apple and the banana. I cut them into small pieces. My mother helped me cut the orange because it was a little hard. I put all the fruit in a big bowl. Then I added some yogurt on top. I mixed everything gently with a spoon. I put the bowl in the fridge for ten minutes. When we ate it, it was cool and sweet. My father said it was delicious. My younger sister asked for more. I was happy. Cooking does not need to be difficult. A simple fruit salad can make people smile. I want to learn more easy dishes. Maybe next time I can make noodles.","zh":"上个星期天，我为家人做了一份水果沙拉。简单又有趣。我用了一个苹果、一根香蕉、一个橙子和一些葡萄。首先，我仔细洗水果。然后削苹果和香蕉。切成小块。妈妈帮我切橙子，因为有点硬。我把所有水果放进一个大碗。然后在上面加了一些酸奶。用勺子轻轻搅拌。把碗放进冰箱十分钟。吃的时候，又凉又甜。爸爸说好吃。妹妹还要。我很开心。做饭不需要很难。一份简单的水果沙拉就能让人微笑。我想学更多简单的菜。也许下次我可以做面条。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e46","title":"A New Pair of Shoes","titleZh":"","en":"Last week, I needed a new pair of sports shoes. My old shoes were too small. They hurt my feet when I ran. My mother took me to a shoe shop. There were many shoes on the shelves. Some were red, some were blue, and some were black. I tried on three pairs. The first pair was too tight. The second pair was too expensive. The third pair was just right. They were blue and white. They were comfortable and not too expensive. My mother said they looked good. I walked around the shop to test them. My toes had enough room. I was happy. I wore them home. On the way, I felt like running. Good shoes are important for sports. If your shoes are bad, you may hurt your feet. Now I can run and play basketball comfortably.","zh":"上周我需要一双新运动鞋。我的旧鞋太小了。跑步时脚疼。妈妈带我去了鞋店。货架上有很多鞋。有些是红色的，有些是蓝色的，有些是黑色的。我试了三双。第一双太紧。第二双太贵。第三双刚刚好。它们是蓝白相间的。舒适，也不太贵。妈妈说好看。我在店里走了走试鞋。脚趾有足够的空间。我很开心。我穿着它们回家。路上我感觉想跑。好鞋对运动很重要。如果鞋不好，可能会伤脚。现在我可以舒服地跑步和打篮球了。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e47","title":"My School Uniform","titleZh":"","en":"Our school uniform is white and blue. Boys wear white shirts and blue trousers. Girls wear white shirts and blue skirts or trousers. We also wear a school badge on our shirts. At first, I did not like the uniform. I thought it was boring. Everyone looked the same. But now I understand why we wear it. The uniform makes us feel like a team. When we go to competitions or museums, people know we are from the same school. It also saves time in the morning. I do not need to think about what to wear. Of course, I still like wearing my own clothes on weekends. But the uniform is not so bad. It is clean and simple. I think the important thing is not what we wear, but how we behave. A neat uniform and a good attitude make a good student.","zh":"我们的校服是白蓝相间的。男生穿白衬衫和蓝裤子。女生穿白衬衫和蓝裙子或裤子。我们还在衬衫上佩戴校徽。起初我不喜欢校服。我觉得它无聊。每个人看起来都一样。但现在我明白为什么穿了。校服让我们感觉像一个团队。当我们去比赛或博物馆时，人们知道我们来自同一所学校。它早上也节省时间。我不需要想穿什么。当然，我周末仍然喜欢穿自己的衣服。但校服也没那么糟。它干净简单。我觉得重要的不是我们穿什么，而是我们如何表现。整洁的校服和良好的态度造就一名好学生。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e48","title":"A Birthday Cake","titleZh":"","en":"Last month, my mother made a birthday cake for my grandfather. It was his seventieth birthday. She did not buy a cake from a shop. She made it at home. She used flour, eggs, sugar, milk and butter. I helped her mix the eggs. It took a long time. The cake was in the oven for forty minutes. The whole house smelled sweet. When it was ready, my mother put cream and fruit on top. She wrote \"Happy Birthday, Grandpa\" with chocolate. At the party, we sang a song. My grandfather blew out the candles. He smiled and said it was the best cake he had ever eaten. I think homemade cakes are special. They cost less, but they have more love. I want to learn to bake a cake for my mother one day.","zh":"上个月，妈妈为祖父做了一个生日蛋糕。那是他七十岁生日。她没有从商店买蛋糕。她在家做。她用了面粉、鸡蛋、糖、牛奶和黄油。我帮她搅拌鸡蛋。花了很长时间。蛋糕在烤箱里烤了四十分钟。整个房子都香香甜甜的。做好后，妈妈在上面放了奶油和水果。她用巧克力写了“祖父生日快乐”。聚会上我们唱歌。祖父吹灭蜡烛。他笑着说这是他吃过的最好吃的蛋糕。我觉得自家做的蛋糕很特别。它们花钱少，但包含更多爱。我想有一天学会为妈妈烤蛋糕。\n\n五、旅行与交通（49—56）","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e49","title":"A Trip to the Zoo","titleZh":"","en":"Last Sunday, my family went to the zoo. We took the underground. It took about forty minutes. The zoo was big and there were many people. First, we saw the pandas. They were eating bamboo slowly. One panda was sleeping on a tree. It was very cute. Then we saw the monkeys. They jumped from tree to tree. Some monkeys came close to the fence. A little girl gave them a banana, but a worker said, \"Please do not feed the animals.\" Next, we saw the lions and tigers. They were resting in the shade. In the afternoon, we watched a bird show. The birds flew over our heads. It was amazing. We walked a lot, and my legs were tired. But I was happy. I learned that animals need care and protection. We should not throw rubbish in the zoo. We should keep the animals safe.","zh":"上个星期天，我们全家去了动物园。我们坐地铁。花了大约四十分钟。动物园很大，人很多。我们先看了熊猫。它们慢慢地吃竹子。一只熊猫在树上睡觉。非常可爱。然后我们看了猴子。它们在树间跳来跳去。一些猴子靠近围栏。一个小女孩给它们香蕉，但工作人员说：“请不要喂动物。”接着我们看了狮子和老虎。它们在阴凉处休息。下午我们看了鸟类表演。鸟儿从我们头顶飞过。太神奇了。我们走了很多路，腿很累。但我很开心。我了解到动物需要关爱和保护。我们不应该在动物园扔垃圾。我们应该保护动物安全。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e50","title":"Going to School by Bus","titleZh":"","en":"I go to school by bus every day. The bus stop is near my home. I usually take the number 12 bus. It comes every ten minutes. In the morning, the bus is often crowded. Many students and office workers take it. I usually stand near the back door. Sometimes I get a seat, and then I read a book or look out of the window. The bus goes along a busy road. I see shops, trees and people. The journey takes about twenty-five minutes. If the traffic is heavy, it takes longer. Once the bus was very late because of an accident. I was worried about being late for school. But the teacher understood. I like taking the bus because I can relax and do not need to ride a bike in the rain. It is also cheaper than a taxi.","zh":"我每天坐公交车上学。公交站离我家很近。我通常坐12路。每十分钟一班。早上公交车经常很挤。很多学生和上班族坐。我通常站在后门附近。有时有座位，我就看书或看窗外。公交车沿着繁忙的马路走。我看到商店、树木和人。路程大约二十五分钟。如果交通拥堵，时间更长。有一次因为事故公交车很晚。我担心上学迟到。但老师理解。我喜欢坐公交车，因为我可以放松，下雨天也不用骑自行车。它也比出租车便宜。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e51","title":"A Trip to Hangzhou","titleZh":"","en":"Last summer, my family went to Hangzhou for a short holiday. We took the high-speed train. It was fast and comfortable. It took only about an hour from Shanghai. In Hangzhou, we visited the West Lake. The lake was beautiful. There were many trees and flowers around it. We walked along the lake and took photos. We also took a boat on the lake. The water was calm and green. In the afternoon, we went to a tea house. We drank Longjing tea. It smelled fresh and tasted a little sweet. The tea house was quiet and cool. We stayed there for an hour. On the second day, we visited a museum. It was about the history of Hangzhou. I learned that Hangzhou is an old city with a long history. The trip was short, but I enjoyed it very much. I want to go there again.","zh":"去年夏天，我们全家去杭州短期度假。我们坐高铁。又快又舒适。从上海出发只要大约一小时。在杭州，我们游览了西湖。湖很美。周围有很多树和花。我们沿湖散步，拍照。我们还坐船游湖。水平静碧绿。下午我们去了一家茶馆。我们喝了龙井茶。闻起来清新，尝起来有点甜。茶馆安静凉爽。我们在那里待了一个小时。第二天，我们参观了一个博物馆。是关于杭州历史的。我了解到杭州是一座历史悠久的古城。旅行很短，但我非常喜欢。我想再去。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e52","title":"My Favourite Way to Travel","titleZh":"","en":"My favourite way to travel is by train. I like trains because they are comfortable and safe. You can walk around, read a book or look out of the window. The views from a train are often beautiful. You can see fields, rivers, small towns and mountains. I also like train stations. They are busy places with many people going to different places. Taking a train is usually cheaper than flying. It is also better for the environment because trains do not pollute as much as cars or planes. Of course, trains can be slow for long trips. But if the place is not too far, a train is a good choice. Last month, I took a train to Suzhou. It took only thirty minutes. I read a book and drank some tea. It was a pleasant journey. I think travelling by train is a relaxing way to start a holiday.","zh":"我最喜欢的旅行方式是坐火车。我喜欢火车，因为它们舒适安全。你可以走动、看书或看窗外。火车上的风景常常很美。你能看到田野、河流、小镇和山。我也喜欢火车站。它们是繁忙的地方，很多人去不同的地方。坐火车通常比坐飞机便宜。它对环境也更好，因为火车不像汽车或飞机那样污染严重。当然，长途旅行火车可能慢。但如果地方不太远，火车是好选择。上个月我坐火车去苏州。只花了三十分钟。我读了一本书，喝了点茶。旅途很愉快。我觉得坐火车旅行是开始假期的轻松方式。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e53","title":"A Visit to the Science Museum","titleZh":"","en":"Last Friday, our class visited the Science Museum in Shanghai. We went by school bus. The museum was large and modern. There were many floors with different exhibitions. On the first floor, we saw a big model of the Earth. It turned slowly. On the second floor, we learned about electricity. We saw how a light bulb works. We also tried a small experiment. We connected wires and made a small fan turn. It was exciting. On the third floor, there was a space exhibition. We saw a model of a rocket and a spacesuit. I learned that astronauts have to exercise every day in space. The museum was crowded, but we had a good time. I liked the experiment best. I think science is not just in books. It is all around us. This visit made me more interested in science.","zh":"上周五，我们班参观了上海科技馆。我们坐校车去。博物馆又大又现代。有很多层不同的展览。在一楼，我们看到了一个巨大的地球模型。它慢慢转动。在二楼，我们学习了电的知识。我们看到了灯泡是如何工作的。我们还尝试了一个小实验。我们连接电线，让小风扇转起来。很令人兴奋。在三楼有一个太空展览。我们看到了火箭模型和宇航服。我了解到宇航员在太空必须每天锻炼。博物馆很拥挤，但我们玩得很开心。我最喜欢实验。我觉得科学不仅在书本里。它就在我们身边。这次参观让我对科学更感兴趣了。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e54","title":"A Walk Along the Bund","titleZh":"","en":"The Bund is one of the most famous places in Shanghai. Last Saturday evening, my parents and I took a walk there. We went by underground. When we came out of the station, I saw many tall buildings with bright lights. The buildings were old and beautiful. They were built many years ago. On the other side of the river, there were modern skyscrapers. Some of them were very tall. The lights changed colours. It was amazing. Many people were walking, taking photos and talking. Some tourists asked us to help them take pictures. We were happy to help. We walked slowly and enjoyed the night view. My father told me that the Bund was very different when he was young. There were fewer buildings and fewer people. Shanghai has changed a lot. I felt proud of my city. It is a place where old and new meet.","zh":"外滩是上海最著名的地方之一。上周六晚上，我和父母在那里散步。我们坐地铁去。出站时，我看到很多灯火通明的高楼。那些建筑古老美丽。它们是很多年前建的。江对岸是现代摩天大楼。有些非常高。灯光变换着颜色。太神奇了。很多人在散步、拍照、聊天。一些游客请我们帮忙拍照。我们很乐意帮忙。我们慢慢走，欣赏夜景。爸爸告诉我，他年轻时外滩很不一样。建筑更少，人也更少。上海变化很大。我为我的城市感到骄傲。这是一个新旧交汇的地方。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e55","title":"A Holiday Plan","titleZh":"","en":"The summer holiday is coming. I have made a plan. First, I will go to my grandparents' home for a week. I will help them in the garden and listen to their stories. Second, I will read three books. One is an English story, and two are Chinese novels. I want to improve my reading. Third, I will learn to swim better. My father will take me to the pool twice a week. Fourth, I will do my homework a little every day so that I do not need to rush at the end. Finally, I will spend some time with my friends. We will go to the park, ride bikes and maybe watch a film. I do not want a holiday that is too busy. I want time to rest and time to do things I like. A good plan helps me enjoy the holiday and not waste time.","zh":"暑假就要来了。我制定了一个计划。第一，我去祖父母家住一周。我帮他们在花园干活，听他们讲故事。第二，我读三本书。一本是英语故事，两本是中文小说。我想提高阅读。第三，我要把游泳学得更好。爸爸每周带我去两次游泳池。第四，我每天做一点作业，这样最后就不用赶。最后，我花一些时间和朋友在一起。我们去公园、骑自行车，也许看一场电影。我不想要太忙的假期。我想要时间休息，也做喜欢的事。好计划帮助我享受假期，不浪费时间。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e56","title":"Coming Back from a Trip","titleZh":"","en":"Last week, I went to Nanjing with my family. We stayed there for three days. We visited the old city wall, a museum and a beautiful park. We also ate some local food. The trip was fun, but coming back was also nice. On the last day, we took the train home. I was tired but happy. When I opened the door of my home, I smelled something familiar. My mother had asked our neighbour to cook some soup for us. We sat at our own table and ate a warm dinner. After dinner, I took a shower and put on my comfortable clothes. I lay on my bed and looked at the photos on my phone. I felt calm. Travelling is exciting, but home is a special place. It is where you can rest and be yourself. I think every trip should end with a happy return.","zh":"上周我和家人去了南京。我们在那里待了三天。我们参观了古城墙、一个博物馆和一个美丽的公园。我们还吃了当地食物。旅行很有趣，但回来也很好。最后一天，我们坐火车回家。我很累，但很开心。打开家门时，我闻到熟悉的味道。妈妈请邻居为我们煮了汤。我们坐在自己的桌边，吃了一顿温暖的晚饭。晚饭后，我洗了澡，穿上舒适的衣服。我躺在床上，看手机里的照片。我感到平静。旅行令人兴奋，但家是一个特别的地方。它是你可以休息、做自己的地方。我觉得每次旅行都应该以快乐的归来结束。\n六、健康、环保与社区（57—64）","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e57","title":"Keeping Healthy","titleZh":"","en":"Keeping healthy is important for everyone, especially students. I try to stay healthy in three ways. First, I eat healthy food. I eat vegetables and fruit every day. I do not drink too many sweet drinks. I drink water instead. I also eat breakfast every morning. Second, I exercise regularly. I play basketball or run for about thirty minutes after school. On weekends, I ride my bike or walk in the park. Exercise makes my body strong and helps me feel happy. Third, I get enough sleep. I try to go to bed before ten o'clock. Sleep helps my brain work well. Of course, I sometimes eat sweets or stay up late. But I try to keep a balance. I think being healthy is not about being perfect. It is about making good choices most of the time.","zh":"保持健康对每个人都很重要，尤其是学生。我尝试用三种方式保持健康。第一，我吃健康的食物。我每天吃蔬菜和水果。我不喝太多甜饮料。我喝水代替。我每天早上也吃早饭。第二，我定期锻炼。放学后我打篮球或跑步大约三十分钟。周末我骑自行车或在公园散步。锻炼让我的身体强壮，帮助我快乐。第三，我睡眠充足。我尽量在十点前睡觉。睡眠帮助我的大脑好好工作。当然，我有时也吃甜食或熬夜。但我尽量保持平衡。我觉得健康不是完美。而是在大多数时候做出好选择。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e58","title":"Protecting the Environment","titleZh":"","en":"Protecting the environment is everyone's job. I do small things every day. I turn off the lights when I leave a room. I do not waste water. I close the tap when I brush my teeth. At school, I throw rubbish into the bin. I do not throw paper on the floor. I also use both sides of the paper. When I go shopping with my mother, I take a cloth bag. We do not use plastic bags. Plastic bags are bad for the environment. They stay in the ground for many years. I also recycle bottles and paper. At home, we have three bins: one for food waste, one for recyclable things, and one for other rubbish. I think if everyone does small things, the world will be cleaner. We do not need to do big things. Small actions every day can make a big difference.","zh":"保护环境是每个人的事。我每天做小事。离开房间时我关灯。我不浪费水。刷牙时关水龙头。在学校，我把垃圾扔进垃圾桶。我不把纸扔在地上。我还用纸的两面。和妈妈购物时，我带布袋。我们不用塑料袋。塑料袋对环境有害。它们在地上留很多年。我也回收瓶子和纸。家里有三个垃圾桶：一个放厨余垃圾，一个放可回收物，一个放其他垃圾。我觉得如果每个人都做小事，世界会更干净。我们不需要做大事。每天的小行动能带来大不同。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e59","title":"A Community Clean-Up Day","titleZh":"","en":"Last Saturday, our community had a clean-up day. Many people came: students, parents and old people. We met at the community centre at nine in the morning. A worker gave us gloves and bags. We worked in small groups. My group cleaned the small garden near the gate. We picked up paper, bottles and leaves. Some people threw rubbish on the ground, so we had to work hard. After two hours, the garden looked much cleaner. We were tired but happy. A neighbour brought us water and snacks. We sat together and talked. I met a boy from another school. We became friends. The clean-up day was not only about rubbish. It was also about people working together. When neighbours work together, the community becomes a better place. I want to join more activities like this.","zh":"上周六，我们社区有一个清洁日。很多人来了：学生、家长和老人。我们早上九点在社区中心集合。一位工作人员给了我们手套和袋子。我们分组干活。我这一组打扫门口的小花园。我们捡纸、瓶子和树叶。有些人把垃圾扔在地上，所以我们得努力干。两个小时后，花园看起来干净多了。我们很累，但很开心。一位邻居给我们拿来了水和点心。我们坐在一起聊天。我认识了一个另一所学校的男孩。我们成了朋友。清洁日不仅仅是关于垃圾。也是关于人们一起合作。当邻居们一起努力时，社区会变得更好。我想参加更多这样的活动。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e60","title":"Saving Water","titleZh":"","en":"Water is important. We use water every day: to drink, to cook, to wash and to clean. But clean water is not unlimited. In some places, people do not have enough water. So we should save water. I do small things at home. When I brush my teeth, I turn off the tap. When I wash my hands, I do not let the water run. My mother uses the water from washing vegetables to water the plants. My father fixed a leaking tap last month. A leaking tap can waste a lot of water in a year. At school, I see some students leave the tap on after washing their hands. I sometimes remind them to turn it off. I think saving water is not difficult. It is about small habits. If everyone saves a little water, we can help many people and protect the environment at the same time.","zh":"水很重要。我们每天用水：喝、做饭、洗和清洁。但干净的水不是无限的。有些地方的人没有足够的水。所以我们应该节约用水。我在家做小事。刷牙时我关水龙头。洗手时我不让水一直流。妈妈用洗菜的水浇花。爸爸上个月修了一个漏水的水龙头。一个漏水的水龙头一年能浪费很多水。在学校，我看到一些学生洗完手不关水龙头。我有时提醒他们关掉。我觉得节约用水不难。它是关于小习惯。如果每个人都节约一点水，我们既能帮助很多人，也能保护环境。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e61","title":"Helping Elderly Neighbours","titleZh":"","en":"In my building, there is an old man who lives alone. His name is Grandpa Zhou. He is about eighty years old. His children live in another city. They visit him sometimes, but not often. My mother told me to be kind to him. So I sometimes help him. I help him carry heavy bags from the supermarket. I also help him take out the rubbish. Sometimes I sit with him and talk. He tells me stories about Shanghai when he was young. He says the city was very different then. I like listening to him. At the Spring Festival, my family invited him to have dinner with us. He was very happy. He said our home felt warm. I think elderly people need company. They do not need big gifts. They need someone to talk to and someone to help with small things. A kind neighbour can make life better.","zh":"我住的楼里有一位独居的老人。他姓周。大约八十岁。他的孩子们住在另一个城市。他们有时来看他，但不常来。妈妈告诉我要对他好。所以我有时帮助他。我帮他从超市提重袋子。我也帮他倒垃圾。有时我坐下来和他聊天。他给我讲他年轻时上海的故事。他说那时城市很不一样。我喜欢听他讲。春节时，我家邀请他和我们一起吃晚饭。他非常开心。他说我们家感觉很温暖。我觉得老人需要陪伴。他们不需要大礼物。他们需要有人说话，有人帮忙做小事。一个好邻居能让生活更美好。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e62","title":"A School Recycling Project","titleZh":"","en":"Last term, our school started a recycling project. Each class had two boxes: one for paper and one for bottles. We put used paper in one box and empty bottles in the other. Every Friday, a group of students took the boxes to a recycling centre near the school. Our teacher told us that recycling saves energy and reduces pollution. At first, some students forgot and put bottles in the paper box. But after a few weeks, everyone learned. Our class collected more than three hundred bottles last term. The school used the money from recycling to buy some new books for the library. I was surprised. I did not know that small actions could make money and help the school. Now I recycle at home too. I think recycling should be a habit for everyone. It is good for the planet and for our future.","zh":"上学期，我们学校开始了一个回收项目。每个班有两个箱子：一个放纸，一个放瓶子。我们把用过的纸放一个箱子，空瓶子放另一个。每周五，一组学生把箱子送到学校附近的回收中心。老师告诉我们，回收节约能源，减少污染。起初有些学生忘记，把瓶子放进纸箱。但几周后，每个人都学会了。上学期我们班收集了三百多个瓶子。学校用回收的钱为图书馆买了一些新书。我很惊讶。我不知道小行动可以赚钱并帮助学校。现在我在家也回收。我觉得回收应该成为每个人的习惯。它对我们星球和未来都有好处。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e63","title":"Healthy Eating Habits","titleZh":"","en":"Many students like fast food. It is tasty and quick. But fast food is not very healthy. It has too much oil, salt and sugar. If we eat it every day, we may get fat or feel tired. I try to eat healthy food. For breakfast, I have milk, eggs and bread. For lunch, I eat rice, vegetables and some meat or fish. For dinner, I have soup and vegetables. I do not drink sweet drinks every day. I drink water or tea. Of course, I sometimes eat fast food. On my birthday, I have pizza with my friends. I think the key is balance. We do not need to say no to all tasty food. We just need to eat healthy food most of the time. Healthy eating is not difficult. It starts with small choices every day.","zh":"很多学生喜欢快餐。它美味快捷。但快餐不太健康。它有太多油、盐和糖。如果我们每天吃，可能会变胖或觉得累。我尽量吃健康食物。早饭我吃牛奶、鸡蛋和面包。午饭吃米饭、蔬菜和一些肉或鱼。晚饭喝汤、吃蔬菜。我不每天喝甜饮料。我喝水或茶。当然，我有时也吃快餐。生日时我和朋友吃披萨。我觉得关键是平衡。我们不需要对所有好吃的说不。我们只需要大多数时候吃健康食物。健康饮食不难。它从每天的小选择开始。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e64","title":"A Volunteer Experience","titleZh":"","en":"Last month, I had my first volunteer experience. I helped at a community library. The library was small and needed help. My job was to put books back on the shelves and help children find books. At first, I was nervous. I did not know where books were. But a kind worker showed me. After an hour, I knew the library well. Many children came that day. Some wanted picture books about animals. Some wanted stories about space. I helped them find what they wanted. One little boy said \"Thank you\" with a big smile. I felt very happy. I worked for three hours. I was tired, but I did not feel bored. Volunteering is not about money. It is about giving your time to help others. I want to volunteer again. I think everyone should try it at least once.","zh":"上个月，我有了一次志愿者经历。我在一个社区图书馆帮忙。图书馆很小，需要帮助。我的工作是把书放回书架，帮孩子们找书。起初我很紧张。我不知道书在哪里。但一位工作人员好心地指给我看。一小时后，我就熟悉了图书馆。那天来了很多孩子。有些想要关于动物的绘本。有些想要关于太空的故事。我帮他们找到想要的。一个小男孩带着大大的笑容说“谢谢”。我非常开心。我工作了三个小时。我很累，但不觉得无聊。志愿服务不是关于钱。它是关于付出时间帮助别人。我想再当志愿者。我觉得每个人都应该至少尝试一次。\n\n七、节日、天气与特别事件（65—70）","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e65","title":"The Spring Festival","titleZh":"","en":"The Spring Festival is the most important festival in China. It usually comes in January or February. Before the festival, people clean their homes and buy new clothes. They put red couplets on the doors. On the night before the festival, families have a big dinner together. We eat dumplings, fish and other delicious food. After dinner, we watch the Spring Festival Gala on TV. Children get red packets from their parents and grandparents. I like the Spring Festival because I can see my cousins. We play games and talk late into the night. On the first day of the new year, we visit our relatives. We say \"Happy New Year\" and give best wishes. The Spring Festival is a time for family and hope. I always feel warm and happy during this time.","zh":"春节是中国最重要的节日。它通常在一月或二月到来。节前人们打扫房子，买新衣服。他们在门上贴红色的对联。除夕夜，家人一起吃大餐。我们吃饺子、鱼和其他好吃的。晚饭后看春节联欢晚会。孩子们从父母和祖父母那里得到红包。我喜欢春节，因为能见到表兄弟姐妹。我们玩游戏，聊天到很晚。新年的第一天，我们走亲戚。我们说“新年快乐”，送上最好的祝福。春节是家庭和希望的时刻。在这个时候我总是感到温暖和快乐。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e66","title":"My Favourite Festival","titleZh":"","en":"My favourite festival is the Mid-Autumn Festival. It comes in September or October. On that day, the moon is round and bright. Families get together and eat mooncakes. Mooncakes are round and sweet. They have different fillings, like nuts or bean paste. My favourite is the bean paste mooncake. In the evening, we go outside and look at the moon. My grandmother tells us the story of Chang'e. It is an old story about a woman who flew to the moon. I have heard it many times, but I still like it. We also light small lanterns. Children walk around with them. The Mid-Autumn Festival is not as big as the Spring Festival, but it is quiet and warm. I like it because it is about family and the beauty of the moon.","zh":"我最喜欢的节日是中秋节。它在九月或十月到来。那天月亮又圆又亮。家人聚在一起吃月饼。月饼圆圆的、甜甜的。有不同的馅，比如坚果或豆沙。我最喜欢豆沙月饼。晚上我们到外面看月亮。祖母给我们讲嫦娥的故事。这是一个关于一个女人飞到月亮的古老故事。我听过很多次，但仍然喜欢。我们还点小灯笼。孩子们提着灯笼走。中秋节不像春节那么盛大，但它安静温暖。我喜欢它，因为它是关于家庭和月亮的美。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e67","title":"A Snowy Day in Shanghai","titleZh":"","en":"It does not snow often in Shanghai. So when it snows, everyone gets excited. Last January, we had a snowy day. I woke up and saw white snow on the trees and cars. It was beautiful. I quickly put on my warm clothes and went outside. My friends were already in the garden. We made a small snowman. We used stones for eyes and a carrot for a nose. Our snowman was not perfect, but we liked it. We also had a snowball fight. It was cold, but we were laughing. School started two hours late that day because the roads were slippery. In the afternoon, the snow turned to rain and melted. But I was happy. I took many photos. Snow makes the city quiet and clean. It is a special gift in winter. I hope it snows again next year.","zh":"上海不常下雪。所以下雪时，大家都很兴奋。去年一月，我们有一个雪天。我醒来看到树上和车上的白雪。很美。我赶紧穿上暖和的衣服出去。朋友们已经在花园里了。我们堆了一个小雪人。我们用石头做眼睛，胡萝卜做鼻子。我们的雪人不完美，但我们喜欢它。我们还打了雪仗。很冷，但我们笑着。那天学校晚两个小时上课，因为路滑。下午雪变成雨，化了。但我很开心。我拍了很多照片。雪让城市安静干净。它是冬天特别的礼物。我希望明年再下雪。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e68","title":"A Birthday Party","titleZh":"","en":"Last Sunday was my twelfth birthday. My parents had a small party for me at home. They invited my grandparents and three of my best friends. In the morning, my mother and I made a cake. It was a chocolate cake. I helped mix the flour and eggs. In the afternoon, my friends came. They gave me cards and a small gift. We played games in the living room. We played a guessing game and a card game. Everyone laughed a lot. At six o'clock, we had dinner. My mother cooked my favourite dishes: sweet and sour pork and fried rice. After dinner, we had the cake. My father put twelve candles on it. I made a wish and blew them out. I wished for my family to be healthy and happy. Then we took photos together. It was a simple party, but I felt very loved. I think time with family and friends is the best gift.","zh":"上个星期天是我十二岁生日。父母在家为我办了一个小聚会。他们邀请了祖父母和三个最好的朋友。上午我和妈妈做了蛋糕。是巧克力蛋糕。我帮忙搅拌面粉和鸡蛋。下午朋友们来了。他们送我卡片和一个小礼物。我们在客厅玩游戏。我们玩了猜谜游戏和纸牌游戏。大家笑了很多。六点我们吃晚饭。妈妈做了我最喜欢的菜：糖醋排骨和炒饭。晚饭后吃蛋糕。爸爸插了十二根蜡烛。我许愿，吹灭蜡烛。我希望家人健康快乐。然后我们一起拍照。聚会很简单，但我感到很多爱。我觉得和家人朋友在一起的时光是最好的礼物。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e69","title":"A Visit to My Grandparents During the Holiday","titleZh":"","en":"During the last winter holiday, I visited my grandparents in the countryside. They live in a small village about two hours from Shanghai. The air there is fresh, and the sky is blue. Their house has a big yard. My grandfather keeps some chickens. Every morning, I helped him feed the chickens. I also helped my grandmother pick vegetables from the garden. We ate fresh food every day. In the afternoon, I walked around the village with my grandfather. He showed me the river where he used to swim when he was a boy. The water was clean and cold. In the evening, we sat by the fire and talked. I did not use my phone much there. I read a book and played with a neighbour's dog. Life in the countryside is slow and quiet. It is very different from Shanghai. I enjoyed it. I think everyone should spend some time in the countryside.","zh":"去年寒假，我去乡下看望祖父母。他们住在一个离上海大约两小时的小村庄。那里空气清新，天空湛蓝。他们的房子有一个大院子。祖父养了一些鸡。每天早上我帮他喂鸡。我还帮祖母从菜园摘菜。我们每天吃新鲜食物。下午我和祖父在村里散步。他带我去看他小时候游泳的河。水又清又凉。晚上我们坐在火边聊天。我在那里不怎么用手机。我读书，和邻居的狗玩。乡下的生活缓慢安静。和上海很不一样。我很享受。我觉得每个人都应该花些时间在乡下。","level":3,"src":"r334"},{"id":"r334e70","title":"Looking Back at My Year","titleZh":"","en":"The year is almost over. I like to look back and think about what happened. This year was busy but good. I learned many new things at school. My English became better. I can now read short English stories without much help. I also made a new friend. His name is Chen Tao. We play basketball together after school. I had some difficult days too. Once I did badly in a science test. I felt sad, but my teacher helped me understand my mistakes. I learned that failing is not the end. It is a chance to learn. In the summer, my family went to Hangzhou. We had a good time. I also learned to cook simple dishes. I can make noodles and eggs now. Next year, I want to be better at maths and read more books. I want to be kinder to my classmates. I think looking back helps me see how I have grown.","zh":"这一年快结束了。我喜欢回顾，想想发生了什么。这一年忙碌但美好。我在学校学了很多新东西。我的英语变好了。现在我可以不太费力地读英语短故事。我还交了一个新朋友。他叫陈涛。我们放学后一起打篮球。我也有过困难的日子。有一次科学考试考得不好。我很难过，但老师帮我理解错误。我学到了失败不是终点。它是学习的机会。夏天我们全家去了杭州。我们玩得很开心。我还学会了做简单的菜。现在我会做面条和鸡蛋。明年我想数学更好，读更多书。我想对同学更友善。我觉得回顾帮助我看到自己的成长。","level":3,"src":"r334"}];
